        '3-5', $q$Giant Pandas$q$, $q$(1) Pandas are cute. (2) Giant pandas live in forests high in the mountains of China. (3) These forests are cool and wet, and they are full of bamboo. (4) Bamboo is a tall plant with hard, woody stems.

(5) Bamboo is the main food of giant pandas. (6) A panda can spend more than ten hours a day eating. (7) Pandas hold the bamboo stems with their front paws. (8) Each front paw has a special wrist bone that works like a thumb.

(9) Baby pandas are very small when they are born. (10) A newborn cub is about the size of a stick of butter. (11) My cousin has a stuffed panda toy on a shelf. (12) The mother panda holds her cub close to keep it warm.

(13) Pandas are amazing.$q$, 'draft')
