values ('18e5d98e-9a06-5cc0-895c-f56cf99bbb74', 'wg3-opinion-writing-p04', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g3-opinion-writing'), null,
        '3-5', $q$The Best Field Trip$q$, $q$(1) Our class gets to choose one field trip this spring. (2) We should visit the Old Train Station Museum in Maple Falls.

(3) First, the museum would help us learn about our town's history. (4) Long ago, trains carried wood, milk and mail through Maple Falls. (5) The museum has old tickets, maps and photos from those days.

(6) Second, the trip would be hands-on. (7) Visitors can climb inside a real train car and ring its bell. (8) We could also try sending a message with an old telegraph machine.

(9) Third, the museum is close to our school. (10) The bus ride takes only ten minutes, so we would have more time to explore. (11) The zoo is fun too, but it is an hour away.$q$, 'draft')
