insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('26d9272b-30fc-5d0f-b352-27d1185d725f', 'wg3-opinion-writing-p06', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g3-opinion-writing'), null,
        '3-5', $q$Kids Should Learn to Code$q$, $q$(1) Computers and apps are part of everyday life. (2) I think our school should teach a coding class. (3) Coding means writing step-by-step directions that tell a computer what to do.

(4) One reason is that coding helps kids solve problems. (5) When a program does not work, you have to find the mistake and fix it.

(6) Another reason is that coding lets kids be creative. (7) Students could make their own simple games, stories or animations.

(8) Coding is also a skill that many jobs use. (9) Doctors, builders and scientists all use computer programs at work. (10) My tablet at home has a cracked screen.

(11) Learning to code now could help us later.$q$, 'draft')
