        '3-5', $q$A Recycling Bin in Every Room$q$, $q$(1) Every day, our classroom throws away a lot of paper. (2) Our school should put a recycling bin in every classroom.

(3) Recycling saves trees. (4) Paper is made from trees, and used paper can be turned into new paper.

(5) Recycling also keeps trash out of landfills. (6) A landfill is a large place where garbage is buried. (7) When we recycle, less garbage goes there.

(8) Bins in each room would make recycling easy. (9) Right now, the only recycling bin is in the cafeteria. (10) Most students forget to carry their paper all the way there. (11) Some students like to fold paper into airplanes.$q$, 'draft')
