insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('4116533f-4d7e-52b2-9891-a1c3dd3db813', 'wg4-opinion-writing-p02', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g4-opinion-writing'), null,
        '3-5', $q$A Chess Club for Kids$q$, $q$(1) Our town library has books, computers, and a big table that sits empty after school. (2) The library should start a weekly chess club for kids. (3) Chess helps kids practice thinking ahead. (4) Each player has to plan several moves before touching a piece. (5) Planning ahead is a skill students also use in math.

(6) A chess club would also help kids make new friends. (7) Players from different schools could meet and learn from each other. (8) My neighbor Tomas joined a chess club in another town, and now Tomas plays with kids from three schools. (9) ______ the club would be cheap to run. (10) Volunteers from town could teach the games for free.

(11) Chess is fun, and it makes kids smarter. (12) The library also has some old maps hanging on the wall.$q$, 'draft')
