values ('1b670fc0-644e-5400-84f1-33824ced6adf', 'wg4-opinion-writing-p03', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g4-opinion-writing'), null,
        '3-5', $q$Band in Fourth Grade$q$, $q$(1) At Cedar Hill Elementary, students cannot join the school band until fifth grade. (2) ______ (3) Learning an instrument teaches patience. (4) A student has to practice the same notes many times before a song sounds right. (5) Music also helps with math. (6) For instance, students count beats and split notes into halves and quarters. (7) Our music teacher, Mr. Delgado, says that young students often learn to read music quickly.

(8) Some families worry that instruments cost too much money. (9) The school could lend instruments to students who need them. (10) In fact, twenty violins are sitting in the music room closet right now.

(11) Last summer I went to the beach with my aunt. (12) Starting band in fourth grade would be fun.$q$, 'draft')
