insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('6f697f4c-d208-5370-bbea-422ed183afc1', 'wg4-opinion-writing-p04', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g4-opinion-writing'), null,
        '3-5', $q$Shade Trees for the Playground$q$, $q$(1) On sunny days, the slide on our playground gets too hot to touch. (2) Our school should plant shade trees around the playground. (3) Trees would keep students cooler during recess. (4) The shade under a large tree can feel much cooler than a sunny spot. (5) ______ trees would make the playground safer. (6) Students would not burn their hands on hot metal.

(7) Trees also give homes to birds and squirrels. (8) Our class could watch them and keep a nature journal. (9) Some people say trees take too long to grow. (10) It is true that small trees need a few years to get big. (11) Still, the trees we plant now will help students for many years. (12) I like the color of maple leaves in the fall.

(13) Planting shade trees would keep our playground cool, safe, and full of life. (14) Let's ask the principal to plant trees this spring.$q$, 'draft')
