   $q$Which sentence should the writer take out because it does not support the opinion?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence (6)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-supporting-detail"},{"text":"sentence (12)","is_correct":true},{"text":"sentence (8)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-supporting-detail"},{"text":"sentence (10)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-opposing-idea"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence (12)$q$, $q$Sentence (12) only tells what leaf color the writer likes, which is not a reason to plant shade trees. Sentence (10) stays because it admits a fair point before the writer answers it in sentence (11).$q$, 'draft', '6f697f4c-d208-5370-bbea-422ed183afc1')
