        '3-5', $q$Our Trip to the Train Depot$q$, $q$(1) Our class gets to choose one field trip this year. (2) We should visit the old train depot museum in town. (3) The depot would help us learn local history. (4) More than one hundred years ago, trains brought mail, food, and visitors to our town through that station. (5) The museum has old tickets, lanterns, and a real conductor's hat.

(6) ______ the trip would be easy to plan. (7) The depot is only ten minutes from school by bus. (8) Entry is free for school groups on Tuesdays. (9) The aquarium is fun too, but it is a two-hour ride away.

(10) The depot museum would teach us about our town's past, and it would be simple to visit. (11) That is why our class should pick the train depot.$q$, 'draft')
